Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 11:42:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Connect LP domains from the dashboard via cPanel API.

Admin stores the cPanel token on the server, tests the connection, and adds a hostname. DNS is verified (including Cloudflare proxy) and Apache proxy is applied by a one-time root helper so WHM is not needed for every domain.
